          "note": "INFO — A03 (DoS / Body Size): parseJsonBody enforces a 1 MB body limit and destroys the stream on overflow (requestUtils.ts L3, L26–34). Both new credential routes parse request bodies through this guard. Positive control confirmed."
        }
